"memory": "Round 1: I own pipeline.js. Interface: processText(text) calls injected tokenize(text). Must return {text, tokens, count, unique, frequencies}. Handle prototype names (constructor) using Object.create(null) for frequencies and unique as array. tokens.join(' ') for text. No external deps. Next rounds: verify peer normalize/tokenize behavior, adapt if needed.",
